Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Chrome Enterprise Core (CBCM) enrollment token — official alternative to fake-mdm.reg.
; Real cloud management makes the device TRUSTED, so off-store policies are honored, not
; [BLOCKED]. Not the Windows MDM signal, so not gated by SUITE_HOME — works on Home too.
; 1. admin.google.com (free CBCM account, verified domain) > Devices > Chrome > Managed
;    browsers > Enroll; copy the token and paste it below.
; 2. Run elevated, restart Chrome. 32-bit Chrome: add the same value under WOW6432Node too.
; Verify: chrome://policy shows enrolled, chrome://management shows managed. Then apply chrome.reg.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome]
"CloudManagementEnrollmentToken"="PASTE_YOUR_ENROLLMENT_TOKEN_HERE"
